{"job_id":"F-f6cf5d47e81e1b8f2324","family_id":"F-f6cf5d47e81e1b8f2324","title":"육군훈련소령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":6,"target_id":"a50e9105baf5b4bef9f23568bd82a59e5b8c69b150308a580613bd2e0305efe8","source_hash":"3aa93ba3029de5a368feecb0e28c1493f7ca6290ec7c5a6f50bcd273671cc78a","text":"陆军训练少校"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":140,"target_id":"30f11ee3eeb8148a248e2883047fae159f64ce64ccf39cdcbd26bb42bfc8bbdc","source_hash":"204f7a447b5b5261b0e20847688baab3585a477fe10953af1b2d197f1cfd8b5e","text":"第 1 条（安装和任务）\n① 在陆军中设立陆军训练中心（以下简称“训练中心”），负责监督陆军新兵的基本军事训练和教育事宜。\n② 国防部长认为有必要时，训练中心可以向除第 1 款所述新兵以外的人员提供训练和教育。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":140,"end":179,"target_id":"9a18154f912c4f51412e95110a9a5381da177a441952a5a25b97d7127894fa3b","source_hash":"67b8f55e83052f9b850673a4b74118d682a8df951f43ff9413eb2f5f022b0e4e","text":"第二条（名称和地点）训练中心的名称和地点由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":179,"end":301,"target_id":"63fa9657037211a6c9286de04850c733b1172007c9784cc455956b357de7cdfa","source_hash":"184580c37a7382268726d5c9b3a9cf0801c47ace9e36125b9e09d5b783cc0175","text":"第3条（委员会）\n① 训练中心任命一名指挥官。\n②少将应被任命为陆军将官。<1992年8月13日修订，2017年9月5日更新>\n少将奉陆军参谋长的命令，负责监督训练中心的运作，并指挥和监督下属人员。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":301,"end":413,"target_id":"adade2367761e15ef426a35000bdd5853774e0e2e49b932929b1436f65913938","source_hash":"b181b90060d15062ed4438b042fb3bc3baa9d9c9c895a7b4b041fbd3c16f839a","text":"第4条（参谋长）\n①训练中心任命一名参谋长。\n② 参谋长应从陆军将官或校级军官中任命。<2024年9月26日修订>\n参谋长协助少将，并在他的命令下协调和监督参谋事务。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":413,"end":529,"target_id":"861f23dd9b5f4373a23fe5242e8f060689801c301e918000d16da47a7e5404ff","source_hash":"f42151d465ee097a13ec136d855abd7803da41f388ab7559ba7369f8f9fa2eeb","text":"第五条（部门和单位的设立）\n①在培训中心建立必要的部门和单位。\n② 第1款所述部门的设立和职责划分事宜由陆军参谋长决定，部队的设立、任务和组织事宜由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":529,"end":573,"target_id":"ffc7a94362d20693943f80f1ee26dec86e4d3cbe3da923963d8102593fd7dfe6","source_hash":"1e3ed62f71b914dca7343a357c3762e9d95bfac99766cbbb8312de9690b78b40","text":"第六条（人员配额）军事人员和文职人员应驻扎在训练中心，人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":573,"end":618,"target_id":"b979e442b10072bf91f91373851e431c48cd369b303cd2d53086ac08edc52045","source_hash":"6b6fa957e42dda94578a6c3b0d598f953858b63b756cc1130694521fe1ac5778","text":"补充规定 <第11045号，1983年2月12日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":618,"end":651,"target_id":"6661cc15db5c120cd6614d63596adfb85d65bdb697d7b69a5979125742be15a5","source_hash":"c72121d5f653513c190fe5e5610dea0327c927771a442a2549941f8ab3f0544f","text":"附录（《军事人员法》实施令》）<1992年8月13日第13708号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":651,"end":681,"target_id":"991c1e6d4d8bfa062fd0ad003cbdc39e8567020f8ae3bcbbed793a88c9b4bfbd","source_hash":"40ac608cf2787f4f50a97c8b940ad8db5f2f59c445aea0216bf6cbd54d933b82","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":681,"end":727,"target_id":"cafbac117907f178d07a2aaab26686d0690469783bfc0d6b31945d9cf93ae068","source_hash":"d64150232a050fd30756dc4f5dcc35d14c40c7cca05700406916213f3a50eb2d","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）① 省略\n\n  ② 陆军训练司令部修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":727,"end":784,"target_id":"272045e34e3732e62fce7027ac63820d8d16f7ff1385c03c7b3c6a1c57d41792","source_hash":"0358568f803482bc3d859d6079732798af80d232236701c2b9273f0beac968d5","text":"第三条第二款如下。\n\n  ② 任命一名少将为陆军将官。\n\n  ③ 至 ⑨ 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":784,"end":817,"target_id":"2a0cbf8fc2269bd490440ed868a018d34d6906474850a5225a315fa6e1b00019","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充条款（《军事人员法》实施令》）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":817,"end":854,"target_id":"0c8849979d389972712a34ae2c457ff9183620d307c0e64d5c58ecc5132ab2bf","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":854,"end":868,"target_id":"7acfdb89be4f1c7c294485d635260fa03a368462d26ae164786ca44902810c72","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"条款 2 和 3 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":868,"end":986,"target_id":"d04fdec9969a4a44631a2fd1959f6cfd58241bebacc4871d30641017bbfb92ae","source_hash":"29f28df625190482ed58dad94544376b0bd6347d24a85c595b7e1837be2534d9","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<72>款省略\n\n  <73> 陆军训练大臣的部分内容修订如下。\n\n  第3条第2款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。\n\n  <74> 至 <90> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004460-265531-ko","scope":"BODY","start":986,"end":1071,"target_id":"1817874afe280aa96058dd0f52bc6c0ec54108db57d9762785faa4ab7346d5ff","source_hash":"f9ae94fb82ee6b9f5449b52ca8fd1939ab32262dfc2c19a1e410b091d84617f9","text":"增补（关于部分修改六项法律以提高军事组织运作效率的总统令）<第34908号，2024年9月26日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。"}]}